3. L3-SVI-SW — VLAN CONFIGURATION
enable
configure terminal


vlan 10
 name IT_INFRA
exit


vlan 20
 name OPERATIONS
exit
4. L3-SVI-SW — SVI CONFIGURATION
VLAN 10
interface vlan 10
 description IT_INFRA_WLC_MANAGEMENT
 ip address 172.20.10.161 255.255.255.224
 no shutdown
exit
VLAN 20
interface vlan 20
 description OPERATIONS_WIFI
 ip address 172.20.10.193 255.255.255.240
 no shutdown
exit

Enable routing:

ip routing
5. DHCP — VLAN 10

Exclude the gateway and WLC:

ip dhcp excluded-address 172.20.10.161 172.20.10.162

Create DHCP:

ip dhcp pool IT_INFRA
 network 172.20.10.160 255.255.255.224
 default-router 172.20.10.161
 dns-server 8.8.8.8
exit
Packet Tracer WLC discovery

Sa Packet Tracer setup natin, ginamit natin:

ip dhcp pool IT_INFRA
 option 150 ip 172.20.10.162
exit

Important: Ito ay dahil sa Packet Tracer implementation na ginagamit natin. Sa actual Cisco WLC deployment, ang DHCP-based WLC discovery ay normally gumagamit ng Option 43, hindi Option 150.

6. DHCP — VLAN 20
